			"notes": "After years of nothing, I finally decided to update this mod.\nWhile at it, I also ported it to the Quilt mod loader.\nIf you're not familiar with Quilt, you can learn about it here: https://quiltmc.org/en/about/newcomer-guide/\nThe TL;DR is that Quilt is a new mod loader that's compatible with fabric.\n\nOther than the port, there is nothing new in this mod. It should work just like it did before!"
